  {
    "function_name": "t",
    "kind": "translation",
    "line": 42666,
    "section": "mod-tome/dialogs/debug/RandomActor.lua",
    "source": "Randomly generate actors subject to a filter and/or create random bosses according to a data table.\nFilters are interpreted by game.zone:checkFilter.\n#ORANGE#Boss Data:#LAST# is interpreted by game.state:createRandomBoss, game.state:applyRandomClass, and Actor.levelupClass.\nGeneration is performed within the _G environment (used by the Lua Console) using the current zone's #LIGHT_GREEN#npc_list#LAST#.\nPress #GOLD#'F1'#LAST# for help.\nMouse over controls for an actor preview (which may be further adjusted when placed on to the level).\n(Press #GOLD#'L'#LAST# to lua inspect or #GOLD#'C'#LAST# to open the character sheet.)\n\nThe #LIGHT_BLUE#Base Filter#LAST# is used to filter the actor randomly generated.",
    "source_tag": "_t",
    "target": "根据给定的筛选器随机生成角色，或/并根据给定的数据表生成随机Boss。\n筛选器由game.zone:checkFilter处理。\n#ORANGE#Boss数据：#LAST#由 game.state:createRandomBoss, game.state:applyRandomClass, 和 Actor.levelupClass处理。\n生成过程在 _G 环境下进行（也是 Lua 控制台使用的环境），并使用当前地图的#LIGHT_GREEN#npc_list#LAST#。\n请按#GOLD#'F1'#LAST#获得帮助。\n鼠标移动查看角色预览（放置到楼层时可能会被进一步调整）。\n（请按 #GOLD#'L'#LAST# 在Lua中检查，或按 #GOLD#'C'#LAST# 打开角色面板）\n\n#LIGHT_BLUE#基础过滤器#LAST#用于过滤生成的随机角色。",
    "args_order": null,
    "special": null,
    "logical_path": "mod-tome.lua",
    "component": "tome",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "events": [
      {
        "commit": "3a82568e2b7d5a49319b89b25f4a31cc87df6465",
        "change": "modified",
        "fields": [
          "target"
        ]
      },
      {
        "commit": "3ab7f682571a8614aaedbbb664b82eac46a85d86",
        "change": "modified",
        "fields": [
          "target"
        ]
      },
      {
        "commit": "c8fe7f762cf39fde93b2267aa6ed2a2afb80ba84",
        "change": "modified",
        "fields": [
          "target"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "baseline_target": "根据给定的筛选器随机生成角色，或/并根据给定的数据表生成随机Boss。\n筛选器由game.zone:checkFilter处理。\n#ORANGE#Boss数据:#LAST#由 game.state:createRandomBoss, game.state:applyRandomClass, 和 Actor.levelupClass处理。\n生成过程在 _G 环境下进行 (也是Lua控制台使用的环境)，并使用当前地图的#LIGHT_GREEN#npc_list#LAST#.\n请按#GOLD#'F1'#LAST#获得帮助。\n鼠标移动查看角色预览（可以在添加到游戏之前进行进一步的调整）\n(请按 #GOLD#'L'#LAST# 在Lua中检查，或按 #GOLD#'C'#LAST# 打开角色面板)\n\n#LIGHT_BLUE#基础过滤器#LAST#用于过滤生成的随机角色。",
    "net_changed": true,
